      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָסִיר</span></big> <strong>s.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:20\" href=\"/Genesis.39.20\">Gn 39:20</a></sup> <strong>cativo, prisioneiro</strong> (árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أَسِيرٌ</span>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܣܝܺܪܳܐ</span>; inscrição moabita, MI <span dir=\"rtl\">אסר</span>). — <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span>, forma absoluta <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:11\" href=\"/Psalms.79.11\">ψ 79:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:21\" href=\"/Psalms.102.21\">102:21</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲסִירִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:22\" href=\"/Genesis.39.22\">Gn 39:22</a> e outras, cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:21\" href=\"/Judges.16.21\">Ju 16:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:25\" href=\"/Judges.16.25\">25</a>, <em>ketiv</em>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲסִירֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:10\" href=\"/Psalms.107.10\">ψ 107:10</a> e outras, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:20\" href=\"/Genesis.39.20\">Gn 39:20</a>, <em>qerê</em>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲסִירָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:34\" href=\"/Psalms.69.34\">ψ 69:34</a> etc. — <em>Prisioneiro</em>: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:20\" href=\"/Genesis.39.20\">Gn 39:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:22\" href=\"/Genesis.39.22\">22</a> (J); alhures, somente poético; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.17\">Is 14:17</a>; como aquele que repousa no sepulcro, livre do opressor: <a data-ref=\"Job 3:18\" href=\"/Job.3.18\">Jb 3:18</a>; sobretudo como objeto da compaixão divina: <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:7\" href=\"/Psalms.68.7\">ψ 68:7</a> (em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחִיד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:34\" href=\"/Psalms.69.34\">69:34</a> (em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶנְקַת א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:11\" href=\"/Psalms.79.11\">79:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:21\" href=\"/Psalms.102.21\">102:21</a> (ambos paralelos a <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי תְמוּתָה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:10\" href=\"/Psalms.107.10\">107:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עֳנִי וּבַרְזֶל</span> (em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">ישְׁבֵי חֹשֶׁךְ וְצַלְמָ֑וֶת</span>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אָ֑רֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:34\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.34\">La 3:34</a>; especificamente acerca dos exilados libertados de Israel: <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.11\">Zc 9:11</a>, chamados <em>prisioneiros da esperança</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַתִּקְוָה</span>, veja-se o versículo <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.12\">12</a>.",
