      "ref": "BDB, אָפָה",
      "preview": "אָפָה: assar, cozer no forno; Qal e Nifal, objetos e usos substantivados.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָפָה</span></big></big> <strong>v. assar, cozer no forno</strong> (assírio <em>epû</em>, Zim<sup>BP 43</sup>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܦܳܐ</span>). —<br><strong>Qal.</strong> Perfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:3\" href=\"/Genesis.19.3\">Gn 19:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָפִיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.19\">Is 44:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאָפוּ</span> com waw consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.26\">Lv 26:26</a> etc.; imperfeito, terceira pessoa feminina singular com sufixo: <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֹּפֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.24\">1 S 28:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.20\">Ez 46:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּאפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:23\" href=\"/Exodus.16.23\">Ex 16:23</a>; imperativo: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:23\" href=\"/Exodus.16.23\">Ex 16:23</a>; particípio: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹפֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:1\" href=\"/Genesis.40.1\">Gn 40:1</a> e outras; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹפֵהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:6\" href=\"/Hosea.7.6\">Ho 7:6</a>; plural: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:16\" href=\"/Genesis.40.16\">Gn 40:16</a> e outras; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.13\">1 S 8:13</a> etc. — <em>Assar</em>, tendo por objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.26\">Lv 26:26</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.15\">Is 44:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.19\">19</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.21\">Je 37:21</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:3\" href=\"/Genesis.19.3\">Gn 19:3</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.24\">1 S 28:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻגֹת מצות</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:39\" href=\"/Exodus.12.39\">Ex 12:39</a> (J); <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.5\">Lv 24:5</a> (H); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.20\">Ez 46:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:23\" href=\"/Exodus.16.23\">Ex 16:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (P; — com segundo objeto indicando a matéria: <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:39\" href=\"/Exodus.12.39\">Ex 12:39</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּצֵק</span>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.5\">Lv 24:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">סֹלֶת</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.24\">1 S 28:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶמַח</span>). O particípio ocorre sempre substantivado: <em>padeiro</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:1\" href=\"/Genesis.40.1\">Gn 40:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:2\" href=\"/Genesis.40.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:5\" href=\"/Genesis.40.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:16\" href=\"/Genesis.40.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:17\" href=\"/Genesis.40.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:20\" href=\"/Genesis.40.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:22\" href=\"/Genesis.40.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:10\" href=\"/Genesis.41.10\">41:10</a> (todos E), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:4\" href=\"/Hosea.7.4\">Ho 7:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:6\" href=\"/Hosea.7.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.21\">Je 37:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִחוּץ הָא׳</span>, <em>fora da rua dos padeiros</em>; também <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.13\">1 S 8:13</a> (em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">טַבָּחוֹת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רַקָּחוֹת</span>; só aqui no feminino). Em nenhuma ocorrência o ofício é considerado servil, nem sequer em <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.13\">1 S 8:13</a>, em que se enfatizam o poder despótico e o crescimento da corte.<br><strong>Nifal.</strong> Imperfeito, terceira pessoa feminina singular: <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּאָפֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.10\">Lv 6:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.9\">7:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.3\">3</a>; feminino plural: <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּאָפֶינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.17\">Lv 23:17</a>. — Passivo do <strong>qal</strong>: <em>ser assado, ser cozido</em>, a respeito de <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.17\">Lv 23:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.9\">7:9</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.10\">6:10</a>.",
